<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Freedom Furniture sets 1.5 cents div.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Freedom Furniture sets 1.5 cents div.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Furniture retailer Freedom Furniture Ltd said on Tuesday it would pay a 1.5 cents a share dividend for the 52 weeks to September 29, 1996.</p>
<p>The fully franked dividend would be paid on February 3, 1997 to all shareholders registered on December 18, the company said.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
